dashboard.definition:
{
  "title": "Multi-Layer Groups",
  "description": "Maps+ layers: markers grouped into toggleable layers, shown in an uncollapsed layer control.",
  "dataSources": {
    "ds_map": {
      "type": "ds.search",
      "options": {
        "query": "| inputlookup chicago-crime.csv \n| eval markerColor=case(like(description, \"%SIMPLE%\"), \"red\", like(description, \"%DOMESTIC BATTERY%\"), \"yellow\", like(description, \"%500 AND UNDER%\"), \"green\", like(description, \"%TO PROPERTY%\"), \"orange\", like(description, \"%RETAIL THEFT%\"), \"darkred\", like(description, \"%TO VEHICLE%\"), \"cadetblue\", 1=1, \"blue\"),\nicon=case(like(description, \"%SIMPLE%\"), \"exclamation-triangle\", like(description, \"%DOMESTIC BATTERY%\"), \"battery-2\", like(description, \"%500 AND UNDER%\"), \"gavel\", like(description, \"%TO PROPERTY%\"), \"building\", like(description, \"%RETAIL THEFT%\"), \"shopping-cart\", like(description, \"%TO VEHICLE%\"), \"car\", 1=1, \"hand-lizard-o\"),\niconColor=case(like(description, \"%SIMPLE%\"), \"red\", like(description, \"%DOMESTIC BATTERY%\"), \"yellow\", like(description, \"%500 AND UNDER%\"), \"green\", like(description, \"%TO PROPERTY%\"), \"orange\", like(description, \"%RETAIL THEFT%\"), \"darkred\", like(description, \"%TO VEHICLE%\"), \"cadetblue\", 1=1, \"blue\")\n| eval description = \"<b>\".description.\"</b>\", tooltip=description\n| table latitude, longitude, description, tooltip, markerColor, icon, iconColor",
        "queryParameters": {
          "earliest": "-24h@h",
          "latest": "now"
        }
      },
      "name": "Chicago crime layers"
    }
  },
  "visualizations": {
    "md_intro": {
      "type": "splunk.markdown",
      "options": {
        "markdown": "The default behavior is to group like icons into the same layer group. Use the `layerGroup` field for granular control over layer grouping. To group all markers into a single layer, simply `| eval layerGroup=\"default\" | table layerGroup`\n\nToggle the visibility of each layer using the layer controls panel in the upper right corner of the map.\n"
      }
    },
    "viz_map": {
      "type": "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus",
      "title": "Multi-Layer Groups, Multi-Cluster Groups, Uncollapsed Layer Controls",
      "dataSources": {
        "primary": "ds_map"
      },
      "options": {
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.allPopups": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.animate": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.autoFitAndZoom": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.autoFitAndZoomDelay": "500",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.bingMaps": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.bingMapsLabelLanguage": "en-US",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.bingMapsTileLayer": "CanvasLight",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.cluster": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.contextMenu": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.criticalThreshold": "80",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.defaultHeight": "600",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.disableClusteringAtZoom": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.drilldown": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.drilldownAction": "dblclick",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.fullScreen": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.googlePlacesPosition": "topleft",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.googlePlacesSearch": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.googlePlacesZoomLevel": "12",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.heatmapBlur": "15",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.heatmapColorGradient": "{\"0.4\":\"blue\",\"0.6\":\"cyan\",\"0.7\":\"lime\",\"0.8\":\"yellow\",\"1\":\"red\"}",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.heatmapEnable": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.heatmapMaxPointIntensity": "1.0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.heatmapMinOpacity": "1.0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.heatmapOnly": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.heatmapRadius": "25",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.i18nLanguage": "en",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.layerControl": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.layerControlCollapsed": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.mapCenterLat": "39.50",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.mapCenterLon": "-98.35",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.mapCenterZoom": "6",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.mapTile": "http://{s}.tile.openstreetmap.org/{z}/{x}/{y}.png",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.maxClusterRadius": "80",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.maxSpiderfySize": "100",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.maxZoom": "19",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.measureActiveColor": "#00ff00",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.measureCompletedColor": "#0066ff",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.measureIconPosition": "topright",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.measureLocalization": "en",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.measurePrimaryAreaUnit": "acres",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.measurePrimaryLengthUnit": "feet",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.measureSecondaryAreaUnit": "sqmiles",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.measureSecondaryLengthUnit": "miles",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.measureTool": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.minZoom": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.multiplePopups": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.pathColorList": "#0003F0,#D43C29,darkgreen,0xe2d400,darkred,#23A378",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.pathRenderer": "svg",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.pathSplitInterval": "60",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.pathSplits": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.permanentTooltip": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.rangeOneBgColor": "#B5E28C",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.rangeOneFgColor": "#6ECC39",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.rangeThreeBgColor": "#FD9C73",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.rangeThreeFgColor": "#F18017",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.rangeTwoBgColor": "#F1D357",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.rangeTwoFgColor": "#F0C20C",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.refreshInterval": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.renderer": "svg",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.scrollWheelZoom": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.showPathLines": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.showProgress": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.singleMarkerMode": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.spiderfyDistanceMultiplier": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.stickyTooltip": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.warningThreshold": "55"
      }
    },
    "md_map": {
      "type": "splunk.markdown",
      "options": {
        "markdown": "### What this shows\n\nChicago crime markers in one cluster group but several toggleable layers. The layer control (top right, uncollapsed via `layerControlCollapsed` = `0`) lists one entry per layer.\n\n### The SPL\n\n```spl\n| inputlookup chicago-crime.csv \n| eval markerColor=case(like(description, \"%SIMPLE%\"), \"red\", like(description, \"%DOMESTIC BATTERY%\"), \"yellow\", like(description, \"%500 AND UNDER%\"), \"green\", like(description, \"%TO PROPERTY%\"), \"orange\", like(description, \"%RETAIL THEFT%\"), \"darkred\", like(description, \"%TO VEHICLE%\"), \"cadetblue\", 1=1, \"blue\"),\nicon=case( ... ),\niconColor=case(like(description, \"%SIMPLE%\"), \"red\", like(description, \"%DOMESTIC BATTERY%\"), \"yellow\", like(description, \"%500 AND UNDER%\"), \"green\", like(description, \"%TO PROPERTY%\"), \"orange\", like(description, \"%RETAIL THEFT%\"), \"darkred\", like(description, \"%TO VEHICLE%\"), \"cadetblue\", 1=1, \"blue\")\n| eval description = \"<b>\".description.\"</b>\", tooltip=description\n| table latitude, longitude, description, tooltip, markerColor, icon, iconColor\n```\n\n### How it works\n\n1. `inputlookup` returns `latitude`, `longitude` and `description` per incident.\n2. `case(like(description, ...))` sets `markerColor`, `icon` and `iconColor` per offence type.\n3. This query emits no `layerGroup`. When it is missing and no `clusterGroup` is set, Maps+ names the layer after the **icon**, so each icon becomes its own layer.\n4. Each layer gets a checkbox in the layer control; unticking it hides that layer's markers.\n5. `description` is wrapped in HTML bold and copied to `tooltip`; `table` keeps the Maps+ fields.\n\n### Field formats and rules\n\n| Field | Format | Rule / gotcha |\n|---|---|---|\n| `latitude`, `longitude` | decimal degrees | Exact lowercase names; required. |\n| `icon` | glyph name without prefix | Names the layer when `layerGroup` is missing. |\n| `markerColor` | png: named color | Must be one of Maps+'s fixed names or the marker is blank. `yellow` (domestic battery here) is not in the list. |\n| `iconColor` | any CSS color | Glyph color; default `white`. |\n| `layerGroup` | any string (not emitted here) | The layer-control entry. Same value, same layer. |\n| `layerDescription` | HTML text (not emitted here) | Label in the layer control; for marker layers the last row in the group wins. |\n| `layerVisibility` | `\"true\"` or `\"false\"` | Per-row boolean; only the exact string `\"true\"` is true, so `\"1\"` means false. |\n\n### Try it\n\n- Append `| eval layerGroup=case(like(description, \"%SIMPLE%\"), \"Simple\", 1=1, \"Other\")` and add `layerGroup` to `table`: two layers.\n- Add `layerDescription=layerGroup` for readable labels, or `layerVisibility=\"false\"` on some rows to start them unticked.\n"
      }
    }
  },
  "layout": {
    "globalInputs": [],
    "tabs": {
      "items": [
        {
          "label": "New tab",
          "layoutId": "layout_1"
        }
      ]
    },
    "layoutDefinitions": {
      "layout_1": {
        "type": "absolute",
        "options": {
          "width": 1440,
          "height": 1310,
          "display": "auto",
          "backgroundColor": "#FFFFFF"
        },
        "structure": [
          {
            "item": "md_intro",
            "type": "block",
            "position": {
              "x": 0,
              "y": 0,
              "w": 1440,
              "h": 170
            }
          },
          {
            "item": "viz_map",
            "type": "block",
            "position": {
              "x": 0,
              "y": 170,
              "w": 720,
              "h": 760
            }
          },
          {
            "item": "md_map",
            "type": "block",
            "position": {
              "x": 720,
              "y": 170,
              "w": 720,
              "h": 1140
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  }
}
